                <triso:itemDefinition name="Eden_AI.SuggestionItem" label="Eden AI.SuggestionItem" isCollection="false" triso:isProtected="false">
                    <triso:description>&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;Represents a suggestion for a misspelled word.

Args:
    suggestion (str): The suggested text.
    score (float, optional): The score of the suggested text (between 0 and 1).

Raises:
    ValueError: If the score is not between 0 and 1.

Returns:
    SuggestionItem: An instance of the SuggestionItem class.
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</triso:description>
                    <triso:itemComponent id="_3bfeaeda-7ab1-4f4e-9436-e55625c18616" name="suggestion" isCollection="false" triso:isProtected="false">
                        <triso:typeRef>string</triso:typeRef>
