                        <triso:description>&lt;p&gt;It can be one (ex: &lt;strong&gt;'amazon'&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;'google'&lt;/strong&gt;) or multiple provider(s) (ex: &lt;strong&gt;'amazon,microsoft,google'&lt;/strong&gt;)             that the data will be redirected to in order to get the processed results.&lt;/p&gt;</triso:description>
